{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4884b935-50da-85b4-9a85-6d070a07e34a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-24T12:25:32-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rafael Salazar",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:23:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:23:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about the road. Well, the edge of the road. It's crumbling at the curve near me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Whereabouts is that? Give me the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's, um, it's been like that since the storm. Sorry, you asked where. 294 Gidley Street, in the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "294 Gidley. And you said it's at a curve?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:16-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, right at the bend in front of the house. The asphalt along the edge is breaking off in chunks, and some of it's washed into the gutter. That was after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Is it out in the travel lane or just the edge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:34-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the edge, mostly. But a neighbor hit it too. Their tire went right in the broken part, I think. They said it jolted the whole car. [pause] Sorry, you asked if it's in the lane. No, it's the edge, but cars cut close on that curve."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That's worth getting looked at. I'll put in the report with the location and what you're describing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:24:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Can you add the street to the repair list? I'd like it on there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll add it to the list, yes. Crews are pretty busy after a storm, so I can't give you a date, but it'll be logged. Do you want a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:14-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0165. Got it. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Oh, sorry, a cardinal just landed at the feeder. I'm a birdwatcher, so I get distracted. That's all, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Enjoy the bird. Thanks for calling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-24T12:25:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
